.idea/
coverage/

# Signing keys and service-account credentials — never commit.
# (apps/mobile/google-services.json is public client config and IS committed: EAS builds need it.)
*service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
credentials.json
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
